# CubeOrangePlus-ODID Default Parameters
# Auto-generated from xplorer-params.param
#
# Parameters marked @READONLY cannot be changed by users via GCS
# Parameters hidden by whitelist won't be visible at all
#
# OMITTED from this file (auto-calibrated or device-specific):
#   - COMPASS_OFS*, COMPASS_DIA*, COMPASS_ODI*, COMPASS_MOT*, COMPASS_SCALE* (compass calibration)
#   - COMPASS_DEV_ID*, COMPASS_PRIO* (device IDs - auto-detected)
#   - INS_ACC*OFFS*, INS_ACC*SCAL*, INS_GYR*OFFS* (IMU calibration)
#   - INS_ACC*_ID, INS_GYR*_ID (device IDs - auto-detected)
#   - INS_*CALTEMP (temperature calibration)
#   - BARO*_DEVID, BARO*_GND_PRESS (device IDs and ground pressure - auto-set)
#   - AHRS_TRIM_* (board level calibration)
#   - STAT_* (statistics - runtime values)
#   - MIS_TOTAL, FENCE_TOTAL, RALLY_TOTAL (mission/fence counts)
#   - RC*_MIN, RC*_MAX, RC*_TRIM (RC calibration - user specific)
#   - FORMAT_VERSION (internal)

